  "texts": {
    "preamble": "R.Udhayakumar vs The Commissioner on 1 April, 2024 Author: G.R.Swaminathan Bench: G.R.Swaminathan W.P(MD)No.73 Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated : 01.04.2024 Coram The Honourable Mr.Justice G.R.Swaminathan W.P(MD)No.734 of 2024 and W.M.P.(MD)Nos.736, 739 and 740 of 2024 R.Udhayakumar ... Petitioner Vs. 1.The Commissioner, Tamil Nadu Food Safety and Drug Administration Department, Dms Campus, 5th Floor, No. 359, Annasalai, Teynampet, Chennai 600 006. 2.The Designated Officer, Tamil Nadu Food Safety and Drug Administration Department, Food Safety Wing, Office of the Deputy Director of Health Services, Viswanathapuram, Madurai 625 014, Madurai District . 3.The Food Safety Officer, Madurai Corporation, Madurai. 4.The Inspector of Police, Sellur Police Station, Madurai. ... Respondents https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis 1/4 R.Udhayakumar vs The Commissioner on 1 April, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/101185067/ 1 W.P ( Prayer : Writ Petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution of In praying this Court to issue a Writ of Certiorarified Mandamus, calling f entire records relating to the impugned proce Na.Ka.No.2871/A2/2023/U.Pa.a, dated 27.12.2023 issued 2nd respondent and quash the same as illegal and consequently permit the petitioner to run the Petty Shop/Coffee and Tiffan centre mentioned in t impugned notice as Udhayakumar Petty Shop situated at 139, Thataneri Mai Road, Bharathinagar, Madurai by unsealing the premises. For Petitioner : Ms.S.Meena, For Mr.A.L.Kannan. For Respondents : Mr.Veerakathiravan, Addl. Advocate General, Assisted by Mr.K.Balasubramani, Spl. Government Pleader for R1 to R3.",
